Rule 24 (other tensor must have at most 8 dimensions)
{v_2: tensor} |= ndim(v_2) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 25 (if both tensors are 1D they must have the same size)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≠ 1 ∨ ndim(v_2) ≠ 1 ∨ shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0)
>>
Rule 26 (tensors must have matching total number of elements if same rank)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≠ ndim(v_2) ∨ ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1]: shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 27 (input tensor dimension sizes must be positive for each axis)
{v_1: tensor} |= ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1]: shape(v_1, i) = 0 ∨ ∀j ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1]: shape(v_1, j) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 28 (if tensors have different ranks they cannot be equal)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∨ ndim(v_1) + ndim(v_2) ≥ 0
